WEBVTT

00:44.030 --> 00:44.750
You're awake.

00:49.030 --> 00:50.240
Were you

00:51.030 --> 00:52.470
pleased with last night?

00:55.840 --> 00:56.670
Very much so.

01:04.480 --> 01:05.430
Where are you going?

01:05.510 --> 01:06.510
I have a gift for you.

01:19.920 --> 01:21.000
Do you remember

01:21.120 --> 01:22.710
when we first met,

01:23.510 --> 01:25.480
it all began because
of the Immortal Vine?

01:25.920 --> 01:26.790
Of course I remember.

01:27.480 --> 01:28.510
You've made another one?

01:28.870 --> 01:29.950
Now,

01:30.350 --> 01:31.680
my feelings for you

01:31.870 --> 01:33.560
run deeper than I ever imagined.

01:34.760 --> 01:35.790
Whenever I look at you,

01:36.120 --> 01:37.790
my heart fills with joy.

01:38.560 --> 01:39.560
Whenever I'm near you,

01:40.350 --> 01:41.920
I can't help but smile.

01:42.400 --> 01:43.680
When our eyes meet,

01:43.760 --> 01:45.472
they're filled with nothing
but tenderness.

01:46.350 --> 01:48.000
So to me,

01:48.280 --> 01:50.040
this is a truly lucky keepsake.

01:53.310 --> 01:54.280
I embroidered a pair.

01:54.790 --> 01:56.590
One for you, and one for me.

01:58.400 --> 01:59.950
They can be our token

01:59.968 --> 02:01.500
and something to remember each other by.

02:01.510 --> 02:02.688
What do you think?

02:02.840 --> 02:03.640
Of course.

02:04.230 --> 02:05.760
Then I'll keep it on me every day,

02:05.824 --> 02:07.312
and never let it leave my side.

03:35.620 --> 03:36.368
=Blossoms of Power=

03:36.368 --> 03:39.220
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:39.300 --> 03:42.260
=Episode 31=

03:43.424 --> 03:45.470
(Taiji Hall)
After the last defeat of the Le tribe,

03:45.520 --> 03:47.088
they finally dropped all pretense.

03:47.136 --> 03:48.960
They have gathered an army
of 3,000,000 and marched against us.

03:48.960 --> 03:51.120
The Northwest Army
is engaged in battle.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.800
Your Majesty,

03:55.136 --> 03:56.870
a dispatch
has just arrived from the front.

03:56.870 --> 03:59.470
The Duke of Wei's
old injuries have yet to heal,

03:59.470 --> 04:01.560
and he has withdrawn
from the front lines.

04:01.560 --> 04:03.080
The battle is at its fiercest.

04:03.080 --> 04:05.470
If he steps down at a time like this,
what are we going to do?

04:05.470 --> 04:06.630
Rest assured, Your Majesty.

04:06.630 --> 04:08.630
The Duke of Wei's command

04:08.630 --> 04:10.520
has been taken over
by Young Master Shen.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.680
It has done nothing to affect morale.

04:12.680 --> 04:15.470
The Northwest Army
is advancing without resistance.

04:16.040 --> 04:17.000
Good.

04:18.190 --> 04:19.190
Good.

04:20.430 --> 04:22.070
Your Majesty.

04:27.070 --> 04:28.270
Excellent.

04:30.120 --> 04:30.920
I had

04:32.800 --> 04:34.600
thought this battle

04:34.830 --> 04:37.270
would surely drag on for a year or more.

04:37.680 --> 04:39.160
At this rate,

04:39.270 --> 04:42.680
I believe it will soon be over.

04:43.270 --> 04:44.040
Good.

04:44.480 --> 04:45.510
Excellent.

04:50.510 --> 04:52.000
Your Majesty's health

04:52.680 --> 04:54.190
has yet to recover.

04:54.480 --> 04:56.430
The medicines
from the Imperial Medical Office

04:56.750 --> 04:58.160
have shown little effect.

04:58.310 --> 05:01.120
Should we summon renowned physicians

05:01.310 --> 05:02.800
to treat Your Majesty?

05:03.560 --> 05:04.270
No.

05:04.480 --> 05:05.630
No medicine

05:07.270 --> 05:09.560
could compare
with today's battle report.

05:11.870 --> 05:13.920
Like father, like son.

05:15.190 --> 05:16.310
Shen Yun'an.

05:17.480 --> 05:18.190
I was

05:18.750 --> 05:20.630
right about you.

05:21.900 --> 05:25.460
(East Palace)

05:27.680 --> 05:29.160
Judging by your expression,

05:29.160 --> 05:30.600
has something good happened?

05:30.700 --> 05:32.390
Xihe, you've come
at just the right time.

05:32.600 --> 05:33.510
Yun'an led the army

05:33.510 --> 05:35.120
and completely crushed
the enemy forces.

05:35.120 --> 05:35.800
Really?

05:35.920 --> 05:36.750
Absolutely.

05:36.920 --> 05:37.720
The victory report is right here.

05:37.720 --> 05:38.430
(Young Master Shen Yun'an led the army)

05:38.430 --> 05:39.620
(and crushed the main enemy force.)
The threat along the northern border,

05:39.620 --> 05:40.480
which has plagued Daxing for a century,

05:40.480 --> 05:41.680
has finally been eliminated.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.620
Yun'an lived up
to everyone's expectations

05:43.632 --> 05:45.150
and achieved a truly unparalleled feat.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.120
This is wonderful.

05:48.400 --> 05:50.800
Father's lifelong wish
has finally been fulfilled.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.480
Xihe,

05:53.120 --> 05:54.000
do you know

05:54.120 --> 05:55.120
this great victory

05:55.120 --> 05:56.190
was not won overnight?

05:56.510 --> 05:57.390
Your contribution

05:57.750 --> 05:58.720
was indispensable.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.000
My contribution?

06:03.430 --> 06:04.390
That's right.

06:04.480 --> 06:07.270
Had you not befriended
Consort Shu with sincerity,

06:07.376 --> 06:09.600
understood the hardship
of her marrying far from home,

06:09.630 --> 06:11.600
and even offered help
to her younger brother,

06:12.040 --> 06:13.920
how could Lanhai have
given its full support

06:13.930 --> 06:15.990
at such a critical moment,
sending troops to assist

06:16.064 --> 06:17.840
and pinning down
the northern desert's flank?

06:18.950 --> 06:19.720
Xihe,

06:20.750 --> 06:21.950
you won with people's hearts

06:22.430 --> 06:23.240
and with your wisdom.

06:23.870 --> 06:25.560
You're always praising me,

06:25.950 --> 06:27.360
making me sound perfect.

06:27.750 --> 06:29.390
But you truly are that wonderful.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.830
It's because

06:31.830 --> 06:33.750
you've always believed in me completely

06:34.070 --> 06:36.070
and always stood by my side.

06:36.920 --> 06:37.750
That's why

06:37.920 --> 06:39.920
you are the bedrock on which I stand

06:40.830 --> 06:42.270
and the wind that parts the waves.

06:49.720 --> 06:51.040
Husband and wife are one.

06:52.630 --> 06:54.160
Seeing your talent

06:54.680 --> 06:55.720
shine so brightly,

06:56.920 --> 06:57.830
my heart

06:58.032 --> 07:00.016
is filled with nothing
but pride and joy.

07:00.430 --> 07:01.310
Your glory

07:01.950 --> 07:03.120
is my glory.

07:16.830 --> 07:19.240
The Grand Empress Dowager
has been complaining to me.

07:19.430 --> 07:22.510
She said she's held
several banquets lately

07:22.510 --> 07:25.190
and invited every noble lady
in the imperial capital

07:25.560 --> 07:26.830
for you to meet,

07:27.920 --> 07:29.630
yet not a single one caught your eye.

07:29.720 --> 07:32.680
I have let grandmother's
efforts go to waste.

07:32.830 --> 07:33.750
Changying,

07:37.270 --> 07:39.190
tell me the truth.

07:40.240 --> 07:42.630
Just what kind of lady do you like?

07:43.480 --> 07:44.070
Father,

07:45.310 --> 07:46.870
there isn't any woman I like.

07:47.870 --> 07:48.600
I

07:49.632 --> 07:51.830
only wish to return to Anlan
and guard the frontier.

07:51.830 --> 07:53.310
To avoid getting married,

07:54.310 --> 07:55.510
you actually

07:55.870 --> 07:57.070
want to hide away in Anlan?

07:57.750 --> 08:00.040
Is it really that difficult
to find you a wife

08:00.750 --> 08:01.750
who truly suits you?

08:02.120 --> 08:03.000
I believe

08:04.040 --> 08:06.120
rather than marrying
a woman I do not love

08:06.510 --> 08:07.870
and ending up an unhappy couple,

08:08.448 --> 08:10.070
I'd rather make the most of my youth,

08:10.112 --> 08:11.240
remain free of attachments,

08:11.552 --> 08:13.240
and devote myself to serving the court.

08:13.870 --> 08:15.000
Starting a family

08:15.600 --> 08:16.510
and building a career

08:16.800 --> 08:18.630
are not mutually exclusive.

08:19.310 --> 08:20.480
To me,

08:21.190 --> 08:22.360
the people of Daxing,

08:22.870 --> 08:23.950
the land of Daxing,

08:24.176 --> 08:25.920
every tree and blade of grass in Daxing,

08:26.630 --> 08:27.630
are the ones

08:29.240 --> 08:30.630
I wish to devote my entire life to.

08:35.240 --> 08:36.080
You really

08:36.440 --> 08:38.480
do have an answer for everything.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.510
I don't believe

08:42.320 --> 08:43.600
there'll never come a day

08:44.360 --> 08:46.080
when you understand
matters of the heart.

08:47.200 --> 08:47.750
I'll

08:48.480 --> 08:49.440
be waiting for that day.

08:49.720 --> 08:50.510
Thank you, Father.

08:57.150 --> 08:58.240
Second Young Lady Shen,

08:58.288 --> 08:59.630
you entered the palace today?

09:00.320 --> 09:01.870
The Grand Empress Dowager summoned me.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.630
Was it also about marriage?

09:06.910 --> 09:08.150
I turned it down again.

09:11.632 --> 09:12.670
Where are you going?

09:13.104 --> 09:13.960
I'll take you there.

09:14.336 --> 09:15.328
I promised my friends

09:15.330 --> 09:17.480
I'd meet them at
the poetry society by Qiaozi Crossing.

09:17.630 --> 09:19.120
The Linquan Poetry Society?

09:19.808 --> 09:22.160
How does Your Highness
know about our poetry society?

09:22.200 --> 09:22.976
Your poetry society

09:23.008 --> 09:25.008
is quite well known
throughout the imperial capital.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.840
I heard you admit only ladies.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.870
Besides discussing
literature and poetry,

09:30.030 --> 09:31.630
you also hold flower
arranging gatherings,

09:31.648 --> 09:33.780
equestrian and archery competitions,
and music appreciation events.

09:33.790 --> 09:36.144
Not only do talented noble ladies
come in admiration,

09:36.200 --> 09:37.600
even gifted young masters

09:37.910 --> 09:39.030
long to join.

09:39.840 --> 09:41.240
Your Highness flatters us.

09:41.630 --> 09:44.030
Our poetry society
has indeed held many gatherings,

09:44.360 --> 09:46.840
and there are many
exceptionally talented noble ladies.

09:47.360 --> 09:48.440
But even

09:48.720 --> 09:50.960
more of them
are ladies with tragic lives.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.670
Some were abandoned by their husbands.

09:53.960 --> 09:55.840
Some were widowed at a young age.

09:56.200 --> 09:58.550
Others were sold
because their families were poor.

09:58.800 --> 10:01.150
They have neither natal families
nor husbands to rely on,

10:01.910 --> 10:03.440
and no skills to earn a living.

10:04.360 --> 10:06.390
It's hard for them
to survive in this world.

10:07.080 --> 10:08.320
But here with me,

10:08.440 --> 10:10.870
they can discover what they excel at.

10:10.992 --> 10:12.816
Then I teach them how to make a living.

10:13.240 --> 10:14.390
One day,

10:14.550 --> 10:16.200
they'll be able to rely on themselves

10:16.200 --> 10:17.670
to build a life in this world,

10:18.000 --> 10:19.952
instead of drifting
wherever fate takes them.

10:20.240 --> 10:21.270
Perhaps

10:21.600 --> 10:23.030
a whole new future awaits them.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.480
What you've done

10:26.480 --> 10:27.550
is truly admirable.

10:29.030 --> 10:30.510
That is no small achievement.

10:31.200 --> 10:33.080
Since I've already
decided never to marry,

10:33.150 --> 10:35.960
I won't be tied down by the affairs
of the inner household.

10:37.270 --> 10:38.550
Life is still long.

10:39.150 --> 10:40.510
I ought to do something meaningful

10:40.912 --> 10:43.390
so I can truly live up to
the freedom I fought so hard to win.

10:50.750 --> 10:52.910
Are court affairs
still keeping you busy?

10:53.630 --> 10:54.910
I asked Father

10:54.960 --> 10:57.024
to let me return to Anlan
and guard the frontier.

10:57.630 --> 10:59.120
But Father didn't want me so far away.

10:59.472 --> 11:01.720
In the end, he allowed me to serve
in the Imperial Guard.

11:02.150 --> 11:04.150
Your Highness has lofty aspirations.

11:04.390 --> 11:07.200
The ladies at our poetry society
often speak of your reputation.

11:07.630 --> 11:09.200
They all admire you greatly.

11:09.550 --> 11:10.200
What?

11:10.870 --> 11:11.790
Could it be

11:11.984 --> 11:13.510
you're trying to play matchmaker, too?

11:15.670 --> 11:17.200
You don't wish to settle for someone

11:17.200 --> 11:18.840
just to fill the place in your heart.

11:19.150 --> 11:20.510
I couldn't agree more.

11:20.790 --> 11:22.080
Rather than leading someone on,

11:22.200 --> 11:23.390
I'd rather remain on my own.

11:23.750 --> 11:25.440
For my own sake and theirs,

11:25.440 --> 11:26.624
that's the only fair choice.

11:27.344 --> 11:29.984
With just those few words,
you've seen right through me.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.000
Second Young Lady Shen,

11:32.320 --> 11:34.576
that alone is enough for me
to call you a confidante.

11:51.420 --> 11:55.220
(East Palace)

12:02.120 --> 12:02.790
What's wrong?

12:06.510 --> 12:07.080
Mo Yu.

12:08.120 --> 12:08.750
Mo Yu!

12:08.870 --> 12:10.040
Go get Mo Yu at once.

12:10.040 --> 12:10.510
Yes.

12:10.510 --> 12:12.740
(Clarity and Serenity)

12:15.360 --> 12:15.790
Here.

12:16.400 --> 12:17.150
Have some water.

12:28.030 --> 12:28.790
How do you feel?

12:31.630 --> 12:32.510
Just now,

12:33.000 --> 12:34.750
I had a very strange dream.

12:36.200 --> 12:37.080
What kind of dream?

12:38.120 --> 12:39.320
I dreamed

12:41.150 --> 12:42.790
we went to admire the lake.

12:43.790 --> 12:44.870
Then all of a sudden,

12:44.870 --> 12:46.840
a school of colorful carp swam by.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.320
One of them was golden.

12:50.150 --> 12:51.510
It was as if it knew me.

12:51.510 --> 12:53.030
It swam straight toward me.

12:58.000 --> 12:58.790
Your Highness,

12:59.030 --> 13:01.030
the maid on duty
said you weren't feeling well.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.510
I've come to examine you.

13:02.840 --> 13:04.720
I'm all right now. Don't worry.

13:04.910 --> 13:06.270
Since Mo Yu is already here,

13:07.150 --> 13:08.440
let her check your pulse.

13:08.910 --> 13:10.240
That way, I'll be at ease, too.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.480
How is the Crown Princess?

13:29.030 --> 13:30.320
Congratulations, Your Highness.

13:30.550 --> 13:32.480
The Crown Princess is pregnant.

13:50.570 --> 13:52.810
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

13:54.140 --> 13:56.390
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

13:57.710 --> 14:02.990
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

14:03.510 --> 14:04.390
Xihe,

14:06.390 --> 14:07.510
we're going to have a child.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.440
We're going to have a child.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.030
Mo Yu, tell me quickly.

14:16.496 --> 14:18.660
Crown Princess is suffering
from severe morning sickness.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.670
Is there anything that can help ease it?

14:20.832 --> 14:22.200
Should she be eating something?

14:22.210 --> 14:23.810
I'll have the kitchen
prepare it at once.

14:23.840 --> 14:25.330
Is there anything else she should avoid?

14:25.344 --> 14:26.750
Morning sickness

14:26.750 --> 14:27.910
often causes a poor appetite.

14:28.080 --> 14:30.030
For now, keep her meals light.

14:30.510 --> 14:32.270
The weather is turning cooler.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.540
Be sure she doesn't catch a chill.

14:33.550 --> 14:35.960
If she catches a cold,
she won't be able to take medicine.

14:36.150 --> 14:37.264
For a pregnant lady,

14:37.264 --> 14:38.740
that's the hardest thing to endure.

14:38.750 --> 14:39.600
Light meals.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.080
Don't let her catch a chill.

14:42.750 --> 14:43.390
What else?

14:44.960 --> 14:46.000
Your Highness,

14:46.048 --> 14:48.672
I've been by the Crown Princess's side
since we were children.

14:48.680 --> 14:51.320
I always knew this day would come.

14:51.670 --> 14:52.870
So I've long been prepared.

14:53.240 --> 14:55.320
Please don't worry too much,
Your Highness.

14:55.720 --> 14:57.600
I'll do everything I can

14:57.696 --> 14:59.424
to take good care of the Crown Princess.

14:59.630 --> 15:02.240
I'll go prepare breakfast
for the Crown Princess now.

15:02.240 --> 15:07.520
♪Stepping out of this long game
of hide-and-seek♪

15:08.270 --> 15:09.910
With Mo Yu and Zhen Zhu here,

15:10.150 --> 15:11.120
don't worry.

15:13.840 --> 15:15.000
Of course I know

15:16.270 --> 15:17.750
how devoted they are to you.

15:19.790 --> 15:21.200
But for both of us,

15:22.630 --> 15:24.120
this is our first time,

15:26.080 --> 15:27.790
and it's a matter
of the utmost importance.

15:28.960 --> 15:30.750
No matter how well we've prepared,

15:32.390 --> 15:33.600
it's hard

15:36.910 --> 15:38.000
not to worry.

16:28.790 --> 16:29.480
You're awake.

16:31.870 --> 16:33.120
What time is it?

16:33.960 --> 16:34.870
It's almost Shen hour.

16:36.750 --> 16:38.390
I've been so sleepy lately.

16:38.840 --> 16:40.150
I wake up late in the morning,

16:40.510 --> 16:42.320
and after lunch, I get sleepy again.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.910
All I do every day is eat and sleep.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.150
I can't get anything done.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.440
Leave everything else

16:49.600 --> 16:51.390
to Zhen Zhu and Mo Yu.

16:52.750 --> 16:53.750
But there's one thing

16:55.120 --> 16:56.440
only you can do.

16:57.840 --> 16:58.720
What is it?

16:59.080 --> 17:00.360
Go take a walk in the garden.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.200
Let's go.

17:04.110 --> 17:04.680
Wait.

17:05.790 --> 17:06.920
I'll get your outer robe.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.440
Your Highness,

17:29.536 --> 17:31.616
there's something
I'd like to discuss with you.

17:33.160 --> 17:33.750
What is it?

17:35.200 --> 17:36.750
About my pregnancy...

17:36.760 --> 17:39.630
I'd like to wait until after the first
three months before making it public.

17:39.640 --> 17:41.590
Once the pregnancy is stable,

17:41.920 --> 17:43.880
I'll deal with any lurking threats.

17:45.640 --> 17:46.160
All right.

17:47.960 --> 17:50.440
That gives me time
to make some arrangements.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.750
Anything we can prevent in advance,

17:52.880 --> 17:53.720
I'll prepare for it.

17:54.510 --> 17:56.480
You always seem
to have everything under control.

17:56.790 --> 17:58.720
Why are you being so cautious this time?

17:59.440 --> 18:00.550
In this world,

18:00.550 --> 18:02.272
there's no such thing as a perfect plan.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.640
We'll take things as they come

18:03.750 --> 18:05.160
and deal with them accordingly.

18:08.680 --> 18:09.350
Your Highness,

18:09.590 --> 18:10.640
what do you think?

18:10.830 --> 18:12.070
Will our child

18:12.350 --> 18:13.790
be a boy or a girl?

18:19.400 --> 18:20.350
Boy or girl,

18:21.880 --> 18:23.680
our child will be my greatest treasure.

18:25.750 --> 18:27.000
If it's a boy,

18:27.350 --> 18:28.400
I hope

18:28.550 --> 18:31.400
he'll inherit his father's
wisdom and virtue,

18:32.070 --> 18:33.550
and become a great man

18:33.680 --> 18:37.000
who can command the situation with ease,
just like his father.

18:39.160 --> 18:40.440
If it's a girl,

18:41.310 --> 18:42.160
I hope

18:43.000 --> 18:44.790
she'll travel the world,

18:45.590 --> 18:47.110
learn from the greatest minds,

18:47.350 --> 18:48.830
and become a lady

18:49.070 --> 18:50.480
of vision and sound judgment,

18:51.030 --> 18:52.400
just like her mother.

18:53.880 --> 18:55.070
Our child,

18:55.880 --> 18:57.750
born into all the love you have to give,

18:58.030 --> 18:59.480
is destined for greatness

18:59.640 --> 19:00.590
and a glorious future.

19:08.440 --> 19:09.960
I never imagined

19:11.310 --> 19:12.590
that I'd one day

19:12.880 --> 19:14.240
mean so much to you.

19:17.110 --> 19:18.310
The ones we hold dearest

19:19.400 --> 19:20.750
will always matter most.

19:24.790 --> 19:26.000
The ones we hold dearest?

19:26.830 --> 19:28.000
I'm not entirely satisfied.

19:28.350 --> 19:29.680
You have too many dear ones.

19:30.680 --> 19:31.920
I want to be

19:31.968 --> 19:32.976
the one you love most.

19:33.590 --> 19:34.590
Say it again.

19:35.550 --> 19:37.200
You're so shameless.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.920
I've already told you I love you,

19:40.110 --> 19:41.750
and you're still hung up on the wording.

19:41.960 --> 19:43.240
Then you needn't say it.

19:44.070 --> 19:45.216
I'll simply

19:45.220 --> 19:47.290
replace it with
"the one I love most" in my heart.

19:49.880 --> 19:50.960
Back then,

19:51.110 --> 19:53.640
whenever I heard you slip sweet words
into every conversation,

19:53.650 --> 19:55.480
I always thought
you were all smooth talk.

19:56.070 --> 19:57.480
But now,

19:57.720 --> 19:59.070
I actually think

19:59.070 --> 19:59.880
it's rather nice.

20:09.380 --> 20:13.740
(Contemplating the Pine Breeze)

20:14.240 --> 20:14.960
Your Highness,

20:15.640 --> 20:17.240
this medicine is far too potent.

20:18.128 --> 20:19.808
You still need
to recover with great care.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.550
Brooding over things

20:22.704 --> 20:24.320
is most harmful to your health.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.350
Yunhuai,

20:30.944 --> 20:33.030
whenever I think about the day
I'm no longer here,

20:35.070 --> 20:36.750
and Xihe is left to raise our child

20:37.830 --> 20:40.350
while fighting alone
in this den of wolves,

20:44.480 --> 20:45.830
my heart aches unbearably.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.680
Your Highness
has already planned for everything.

21:00.680 --> 21:02.350
Even if that day should ever come,

21:03.030 --> 21:05.830
the Crown Princess
would never be left without support.

21:10.912 --> 21:12.750
The Crown Princess
commands the inner palace.

21:14.310 --> 21:16.030
She has the
Duke of Wei's Manor behind her,

21:16.680 --> 21:20.000
and has won over both Shunan and Lanhai.

21:20.350 --> 21:21.750
With their military support,

21:23.350 --> 21:24.400
and throughout the court,

21:25.720 --> 21:27.110
from the Director of the Secretariat

21:28.030 --> 21:29.270
down to the local officials,

21:30.160 --> 21:31.440
everything has been arranged.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.830
It's just that I can't accept

21:43.880 --> 21:45.790
that I won't be by her side,

21:47.200 --> 21:49.160
or grow old together with her.

21:52.550 --> 21:54.110
For the one you love most,

21:54.880 --> 21:56.000
no matter how much you do,

21:56.920 --> 21:58.200
it never feels like enough.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.030
Yunhuai,

22:04.440 --> 22:05.790
I was once just like you.

22:06.080 --> 22:08.224
My heart belonged
to the mountains and rivers,

22:08.350 --> 22:09.590
and I longed to roam the world.

22:12.030 --> 22:13.510
Until I met her.

22:15.510 --> 22:16.550
For the rest of my life,

22:18.550 --> 22:20.310
I only want to stay by her side.

22:21.590 --> 22:23.240
If there is truly a way

22:23.750 --> 22:25.550
to let me stay with her a little longer,

22:27.056 --> 22:29.392
even if it means enduring the agony
of reforging my body,

22:29.640 --> 22:30.920
through endless hardship,

22:33.200 --> 22:34.510
I am willing to do it.

22:47.220 --> 22:54.060
(Eight years old)

22:54.060 --> 22:56.900
(Ten years old)

23:43.740 --> 23:46.060
(Three years old)

23:46.060 --> 23:48.700
(Four years old)

23:48.780 --> 23:51.020
(Seven years old)

23:51.020 --> 23:53.780
(Eight years old)

23:53.780 --> 23:56.620
(Thirteen years old)

23:56.620 --> 23:59.100
(Fourteen years old)

23:59.100 --> 24:00.300
(Fifteen years old)

24:13.680 --> 24:14.310
Your Highness,

24:14.790 --> 24:16.510
you're reading so many books these days.

24:19.790 --> 24:21.750
These are all for my child.

24:24.160 --> 24:26.900
Whether it's a boy or a girl, they
should study and learn what is right.

24:26.920 --> 24:28.912
From early childhood
enlightenment at the age of one

24:29.030 --> 24:30.790
to the teachings
of the sages at fifteen,

24:31.240 --> 24:32.400
I've already prepared

24:32.640 --> 24:33.790
what they'll read each year.

24:46.048 --> 24:48.176
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

24:48.310 --> 24:48.830
Rise.

24:49.000 --> 24:50.240
May I ask, Your Highness,

24:50.240 --> 24:51.510
why you summoned

24:51.536 --> 24:53.344
the two of us to the palace so urgently?

24:57.880 --> 24:58.550
Zhenghao,

25:00.310 --> 25:01.110
there's something

25:01.880 --> 25:02.830
I'd like to ask of you.

25:04.240 --> 25:05.550
If Your Highness has any orders,

25:05.550 --> 25:07.280
I will carry them out
with all my strength.

25:07.760 --> 25:09.200
There's no need to call it a favor.

25:09.488 --> 25:10.960
You honor me far beyond my station.

25:10.960 --> 25:14.100
You earned your place in the Embroidered
Envoys through the martial examination.

25:14.112 --> 25:14.912
In just two years,

25:15.072 --> 25:16.240
you rose from the lowest rank

25:16.550 --> 25:17.830
to become the Chief Envoy.

25:17.830 --> 25:19.000
In all of Daxing,

25:19.110 --> 25:20.640
you are among the very best.

25:20.640 --> 25:22.480
After the child is born,

25:22.576 --> 25:23.780
whether it's a boy or a girl,

25:23.790 --> 25:24.550
I'd like you

25:24.656 --> 25:26.070
to be their martial arts teacher.

25:26.200 --> 25:27.400
Their martial arts teacher?

25:27.510 --> 25:28.030
Yes.

25:31.110 --> 25:32.830
I've been poisoned since childhood.

25:32.880 --> 25:34.590
Had I not devoted myself
to martial arts,

25:34.590 --> 25:36.080
I would never have survived this long.

25:36.240 --> 25:38.720
I know better than anyone
how important a strong body is.

25:38.880 --> 25:40.270
I hope this child

25:40.304 --> 25:42.096
will not only be able
to protect themselves,

25:42.160 --> 25:44.240
but also have the strength
to protect their mother.

25:44.240 --> 25:45.520
If it's a prince, don't spoil him.

25:45.530 --> 25:47.310
Strict teachers
produce exceptional students.

25:47.340 --> 25:48.656
If he misbehaves, discipline him.

25:48.672 --> 25:49.880
I'll leave it entirely to you.

25:52.000 --> 25:53.030
If it's a princess,

25:53.350 --> 25:54.480
then I'd ask you

25:55.000 --> 25:56.200
to watch over her always

25:56.590 --> 25:57.510
and care for her well.

25:59.400 --> 26:00.480
I accept your command.

26:00.920 --> 26:02.480
I will pass on everything

26:02.590 --> 26:03.720
I've learned in my lifetime

26:04.350 --> 26:05.880
and never fail Your Highness's trust.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.510
Yunhuai,

26:10.640 --> 26:12.160
you've traveled far and wide

26:12.350 --> 26:13.400
and seen much of the world.

26:13.400 --> 26:15.270
Once the child turns five,

26:15.590 --> 26:17.000
alongside their studies,

26:17.056 --> 26:18.750
I'd like you to take them
out of the palace

26:19.240 --> 26:21.240
to see more
of the world's mountains and rivers.

26:21.312 --> 26:22.110
What do you think?

26:22.110 --> 26:23.390
One should read ten thousand books

26:23.400 --> 26:24.590
and travel ten thousand miles.

26:25.510 --> 26:27.720
Let them experience
the lives of the people

26:28.110 --> 26:29.510
and understand their hardships.

26:30.000 --> 26:30.550
Yes.

26:32.350 --> 26:34.550
How can someone
who only sits upon the highest throne,

26:34.720 --> 26:36.440
pampered with every luxury,

26:36.450 --> 26:38.960
ever possess the vision and resolve
to embrace all under heaven?

26:39.000 --> 26:41.400
And how could they possess
true compassion and impartiality?

26:42.830 --> 26:44.400
With you to guide and teach them,

26:44.550 --> 26:45.350
I can rest easy.

26:50.070 --> 26:51.160
I'm counting on you both.

26:52.560 --> 26:54.496
- I accept Your Highness's command.
- I accept Your Highness's command.

26:54.510 --> 26:56.832
- We'll never fail your trust.
- We'll never fail your trust.

27:07.220 --> 27:08.740
(Sixian Hall)

27:13.240 --> 27:14.030
Your Highness.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.790
I've summoned you here today

27:21.200 --> 27:23.160
to announce something important.

27:24.920 --> 27:25.960
At last,

27:26.350 --> 27:28.080
I've freed you from your servant status.

27:31.240 --> 27:32.310
Your Highness,

27:33.000 --> 27:34.070
do you mean...

27:34.112 --> 27:36.032
Ever since I took charge
of the Six Palaces,

27:36.070 --> 27:37.750
I've been planning this.

27:39.110 --> 27:40.200
These are your papers.

27:40.790 --> 27:41.510
Keep them safe.

27:44.550 --> 27:45.640
From this day forward,

27:45.808 --> 27:48.420
(Mo Yu is registered as a commoner)
you are no longer servants.

27:48.440 --> 27:50.990
(Eligible for appointment as a Fifth-Rank Palace Matron)
You have also been made fifth-rank palace officials.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.510
Even after you marry,

27:52.510 --> 27:54.310
you may continue serving in the palace.

27:55.936 --> 27:57.790
- Thank you for Your Highness's grace.
- Thank you for Your Highness's grace.

27:57.790 --> 27:58.480
Get up.

27:59.720 --> 28:00.750
All these years,

28:01.030 --> 28:02.720
you've always stayed by my side.

28:03.550 --> 28:04.960
Everything you've done for me,

28:05.160 --> 28:06.310
I've kept in my heart.

28:06.400 --> 28:08.590
I've long since thought of you
as my younger sisters.

28:14.400 --> 28:15.480
From this day forward,

28:16.110 --> 28:18.160
you'll have more choices.

28:19.270 --> 28:20.480
If one day

28:20.680 --> 28:22.110
you meet a man you truly love,

28:22.310 --> 28:23.400
just tell me.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.310
I'll prepare

28:25.310 --> 28:26.960
a generous dowry for you,

28:27.200 --> 28:28.920
and marry you off in grand style,

28:29.110 --> 28:31.400
with all the honors due a noble lady.

28:31.680 --> 28:34.310
If your ambition
lies in official service,

28:34.400 --> 28:36.640
and you wish to pursue
a career as a palace official,

28:37.072 --> 28:38.270
I'll support you as well.

28:39.310 --> 28:41.200
Rely on your own abilities

28:41.640 --> 28:43.720
to make a name for yourselves
in the palace.

28:44.030 --> 28:45.160
For the rest of my life,

28:45.160 --> 28:46.550
I only wish to remain by your side.

28:46.624 --> 28:48.720
Your Highness has reached
the third month of your pregnancy.

28:48.720 --> 28:50.590
This is when you
need people around you most.

28:51.030 --> 28:52.070
Zhen Zhu and I

28:52.200 --> 28:53.680
won't leave your side.

28:53.680 --> 28:56.030
From now on, leave the palace affairs
to Mo Yu and me.

28:56.310 --> 28:58.830
You and His Highness
can tend the flowers,

28:58.830 --> 28:59.830
make tea and paint,

28:59.920 --> 29:01.920
play the qin, compose music,
play chess,

29:01.920 --> 29:04.080
and talk about the little prince
and little princess.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.720
Please don't send us away.

29:07.590 --> 29:09.070
No one's sending you away.

29:09.880 --> 29:11.070
If you

29:11.070 --> 29:12.720
wish to remain by my side,

29:13.680 --> 29:14.790
then stay here.

29:16.000 --> 29:17.440
But these papers

29:17.790 --> 29:18.880
must be kept safe.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.000
They represent

29:21.240 --> 29:23.590
a future where you will no longer
be bound by your status.

29:24.510 --> 29:26.000
Whatever path you choose,

29:26.448 --> 29:28.030
you'll be able to hold your head high

29:28.030 --> 29:29.230
and live with greater dignity.

30:36.720 --> 30:39.000
I came especially to visit you,
Brother-in-law.

30:39.360 --> 30:41.584
As luck would have it,
you were practicing your sword.

30:41.590 --> 30:42.590
I told you before

30:44.160 --> 30:45.510
not to come to my manor again.

30:48.790 --> 30:51.310
You haven't been to court
these past few days.

30:51.720 --> 30:53.720
I came to bring you some news.

30:56.350 --> 30:57.350
The East Palace

30:57.750 --> 31:00.830
has informed His Majesty and
Grand Empress Dowager of the good news.

31:01.440 --> 31:02.590
The Crown Princess

31:04.400 --> 31:05.400
is expecting.

31:22.240 --> 31:23.880
On my way here,

31:24.920 --> 31:25.550
just imagining

31:25.550 --> 31:27.590
the look on your face
when you heard the news

31:27.590 --> 31:29.070
got my blood racing.

31:29.680 --> 31:31.240
You really didn't disappoint me.

31:42.480 --> 31:44.400
Admit it, Changqing.

31:47.590 --> 31:49.200
You and I are the same.

31:50.030 --> 31:51.550
When we want something,

31:52.480 --> 31:54.270
we'll stop at nothing to get it.

31:56.830 --> 31:58.350
The difference between us

31:59.310 --> 32:00.750
is that if I can't have it,

32:02.160 --> 32:03.590
I'll destroy it.

32:05.720 --> 32:06.590
Changqing.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.880
You can't bear to do it.

32:08.440 --> 32:09.720
Do you want me to help you?

32:19.440 --> 32:20.750
Touch her if you dare.

32:22.720 --> 32:24.110
The more you care,

32:25.160 --> 32:26.960
the more excited I become.

33:28.432 --> 33:29.720
Please forgive me, Prince Xin.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.590
I deserve to die.

33:30.680 --> 33:31.830
I didn't mean it.

33:32.160 --> 33:33.270
Why did the incense break?

33:35.830 --> 33:36.550
Speak!

33:36.816 --> 33:37.968
Why did the incense break?

33:37.970 --> 33:39.270
Please calm your anger, Prince Xin.

33:39.270 --> 33:41.150
If the incense broke,
simply light another stick.

33:41.160 --> 33:42.920
Why let it upset you
and harm your health?

33:42.976 --> 33:44.592
If Her Highness knows in the afterlife,

33:44.680 --> 33:45.830
she'll be distressed as well.

33:52.790 --> 33:53.880
The incense broke

33:56.480 --> 33:58.110
to tell Qingzhi

33:58.448 --> 34:00.300
that our bond in this life
has come to an end,

34:00.310 --> 34:02.144
and we shall
never meet again in the next.

34:03.790 --> 34:04.790
Its breaking

34:06.790 --> 34:08.480
means Qingzhi and I

34:11.320 --> 34:12.800
are to be parted forever.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.630
Replace it!

34:18.510 --> 34:19.070
Yes.

34:28.380 --> 34:34.060
(The Late Lady Gu)

34:42.710 --> 34:43.760
Qingqing,

34:44.590 --> 34:45.670
from that day on,

34:47.230 --> 34:48.440
I replaced this incense

34:49.550 --> 34:51.360
with agarwood that never breaks.

34:51.550 --> 34:52.880
Lifetime after lifetime,

34:54.510 --> 34:55.800
we'll be together forever.

34:59.920 --> 35:01.710
You will always be my wife.

35:25.190 --> 35:26.550
Yunhuai.

35:27.280 --> 35:27.920
Your Highness.

35:30.960 --> 35:32.230
Tell me the truth.

35:37.230 --> 35:39.710
Am I already beyond cure?

35:41.320 --> 35:42.510
Your Highness,

35:44.480 --> 35:46.030
the strange poison has flared up again.

35:47.280 --> 35:48.480
It has penetrated your bones.

35:49.590 --> 35:50.510
All three meridians

35:51.710 --> 35:52.960
have already been corrupted.

35:54.840 --> 35:56.000
There's no reversing it.

36:00.440 --> 36:02.590
Does that mean I could...

36:13.030 --> 36:14.510
Please forgive my incompetence.

36:26.360 --> 36:28.360
I know you still have one medicine

36:32.320 --> 36:35.550
that can let me live like
an ordinary man for a few more days.

36:36.880 --> 36:37.480
You mustn't.

36:39.320 --> 36:40.800
That medicine is extremely dangerous.

36:42.150 --> 36:43.280
Once the floodgates burst,

36:43.280 --> 36:44.510
there will be no turning back.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.840
Go and bring it to me.

36:49.000 --> 36:49.630
Your Highness.

36:54.400 --> 36:56.230
Xihe is with child.

36:57.840 --> 37:00.110
I want to be with them as best I can.

37:33.760 --> 37:35.400
What are you thinking about?

37:40.590 --> 37:41.630
I was thinking...

37:42.400 --> 37:44.320
Even knowing my life hangs by a thread,

37:46.230 --> 37:48.190
I still can't bear to let you go.

37:51.510 --> 37:52.320
I owe you

37:54.000 --> 37:55.670
far too much.

37:59.510 --> 38:01.110
I chose you as my husband

38:01.110 --> 38:02.864
because you
wouldn't live long, remember?

38:03.550 --> 38:04.760
The two of us

38:04.760 --> 38:07.000
are perfectly matched.

38:07.190 --> 38:08.280
We each got what we wanted.

38:15.280 --> 38:16.150
Besides,

38:17.440 --> 38:18.840
I never intended to remarry.

38:19.880 --> 38:21.320
In my lifetime,

38:22.030 --> 38:23.360
I will have only one husband.

38:35.230 --> 38:38.000
Youyou and Luming.

38:38.230 --> 38:41.360
A match made in heaven.

38:57.440 --> 38:59.150
Has the baby
been giving you trouble today?

39:02.550 --> 39:04.360
I think the baby just kicked me.

39:04.880 --> 39:06.230
Silly.

39:06.230 --> 39:08.150
The baby's so tiny. How could it kick?

39:12.000 --> 39:12.960
Little Goldfish,

39:13.440 --> 39:15.070
be good to your mother.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.590
Don't be so naughty.

39:17.000 --> 39:18.550
What if you hurt your mother?

39:19.480 --> 39:20.550
Little Goldfish?

39:22.800 --> 39:24.710
That's the nickname
I've chosen for our child.

39:25.536 --> 39:26.760
Whether it's a boy or a girl.

39:34.976 --> 39:36.480
I've already picked a given name.

39:37.880 --> 39:38.760
Xiao Junshu.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.510
Junshu?

39:42.150 --> 39:43.840
The name Junshu

39:43.840 --> 39:45.510
symbolizes one who governs the realm.

39:45.920 --> 39:47.320
That's too weighty.

39:47.550 --> 39:49.030
Will Father approve?

39:49.440 --> 39:50.550
Our child's name

39:50.960 --> 39:52.920
is for you and me alone to decide.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.070
Trust me.

39:59.710 --> 40:00.670
He'll agree.

40:05.150 --> 40:06.000
I trust you.

40:19.500 --> 40:26.060
(The Grave of My Wife, Li Yanhui.
Husband, Xiao Changtai)

40:34.630 --> 40:35.480
Changtai,

40:36.710 --> 40:38.000
are you really going?

40:43.510 --> 40:44.710
From the very beginning,

40:46.110 --> 40:48.110
he never saw me as his own son.

40:50.030 --> 40:51.190
My future,

40:52.070 --> 40:53.110
my love,

40:53.550 --> 40:54.630
my wife,

40:56.030 --> 40:58.400
he destroyed them all.

40:58.544 --> 41:00.400
Now that I've reached
the end of the road,

41:02.230 --> 41:04.630
I have nothing left to fear.

41:05.664 --> 41:07.840
Once you take this path,
there's no turning back.

41:08.816 --> 41:10.960
If you stop now, change your name,
and disappear,

41:11.320 --> 41:13.280
you might still live out
the rest of your days.

41:16.840 --> 41:17.960
Without you,

41:19.960 --> 41:21.630
what life would I have left?

41:21.780 --> 41:24.260
(The Grave of My Wife, Li Yanhui.
Husband, Xiao Changtai)

41:24.280 --> 41:25.880
I will make him regret

41:27.110 --> 41:29.440
looking down on me,

41:31.030 --> 41:32.230
and using me all these years.

41:47.920 --> 41:49.480
Now that you know the truth,

41:50.030 --> 41:51.400
why do you still try to stop me?

41:54.230 --> 41:55.920
Xihe,

41:56.110 --> 41:59.230
I'm sorry for barging into

41:59.400 --> 42:00.480
your life.

42:00.760 --> 42:02.070
I only hope

42:02.320 --> 42:05.030
you'll never regret marrying me...

42:09.510 --> 42:12.450
♪I've hidden so many words♪

42:13.070 --> 42:15.870
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

42:16.740 --> 42:23.710
♪So never uncover♪

42:23.900 --> 42:26.260
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

42:27.390 --> 42:30.120
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

42:31.080 --> 42:36.420
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

42:38.180 --> 42:41.000
♪Every answer I gave♪

42:41.800 --> 42:44.650
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

42:45.440 --> 42:48.810
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

42:49.070 --> 42:52.380
♪How hard it truly was?♪

42:55.350 --> 42:58.790
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

42:59.780 --> 43:02.110
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

43:03.380 --> 43:09.140
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

43:10.550 --> 43:13.680
♪It's a shame I never could♪

43:14.130 --> 43:17.140
♪Give you a moon in return♪

43:17.250 --> 43:23.890
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

43:23.890 --> 43:27.560
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

43:28.430 --> 43:31.190
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

43:31.630 --> 43:34.760
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

